Package: fp-match-service
Version: 1.0.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: default-jre (>= 2:1.11) | openjdk-17-jre | temurin-17-jre
Maintainer: Verification Portal <ops@example.com>
Description: Server-side fingerprint matching daemon for the Verification Portal
 Wraps SourceAFIS (Apache 2.0, pure Java) behind a localhost JSON API on
 port 8050. Runs as a systemd unit on the central EC2 server. The portal
 backend forwards FMR templates (probe from any vendor's operator-laptop
 daemon, gallery from the candidate index) through this service and stores
 the 1:1 similarity score on the verification audit row. Vendor-neutral:
 supports ISO/IEC 19794-2 FMR and ANSI INCITS 378 templates regardless of
 which SDK extracted them.
